# verso-dataset — mamlakat/joy ma'lumotlarini tayyorlash uchun ishchi
# papka. Uning foydali natijasi (matn, tarjima, faktlar, tanlangan
# rasmlar) allaqachon frontend/backend'ning o'z fayllariga birlashtirildi
# (countries.ts, country-prose/, global-places.ts, global-knowledge-base.ts,
# country-images/, global-place-images/). C_images/ o'zi 72 MB — asl
# jpg+webp nusxalari, ulardan foydali bo'lgan 83 tasi allaqachon
# nusxalangan — qolgani reponi keraksiz og'irlashtiradi. Matn manbalari
# (A_countries/, B_places/, D_translations/, scripts/) juda kichik va
# kelajakda foydali bo'lishi mumkin, shuning uchun saqlanadi.
backend/src/data/verso-dataset/C_images/
backend/src/data/verso-dataset/output/

# Taqdimot fayllari repoga kerak emas
*.pptx
